You know, we've always wanted to do this. I kept wondering when we could finally do it for 55 years.

73
00:05:21,588 --> 00:05:23,608
55年？
55 years?

74
00:05:23,608 --> 00:05:26,608
550年ぐらい？うん、いっぱい待ってて。
